data: {"id": "7b391d10f01b4e03-final", "run_id": "7b391d10f01b4e03", "seq": 1407, "ts_ms": 1788419411693, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态，Volume input 挂载持续失败 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 直接证明 volume 'input' 因 ConfigMap 缺失导致挂载失败 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod 状态：`Pending`；Container 状态：`ContainerCreating` | 确认 Pod 卡在启动阶段，未进入 Running 状态 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod Condition: `ContainersReady=False (ContainersNotReady)`, `Ready=False` | 确认容器不可用且 Pod 整体不满足就绪条件 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` | 独立确认容器处于等待挂载资源的特定状态 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"} = 1` | 独立确认 Pod 停留在 Pending 阶段 |\n\n**证据分析：**\n1. Kubernetes 事件（证据 1）明确指出了根因是 ConfigMap 缺失，这与容器状态（证据 2、3）和 Metrics（证据 4、5）中反映的“等待挂载”和“Pending”状态完全一致。\n2. 缺失的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 在输入事实中不存在，无法确认其是意外删除还是从未创建。\n3. 日志和 Tracing 因容器未启动而无法获取，但不影响基于 K8s 状态和事件的结论。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 缺失 → kubelet 挂载 volume 'input' 失败 → Pod 持续 Pending → 容器无法启动\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：** Pod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` 的 Volume `input` 强依赖 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，但该 ConfigMap 在 namespace `aiops-case-03` 中不存在。这导致 kubelet 执行 `MountVolume.SetUp` 时失败，Pod 因此无法从 `Pending` 状态进入 `Running` 状态，表现为 `ContainerCreating` 持续等待。\n\n**证据支撑：**\n- K8s Event 报错 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` 直接定位了缺失资源。\n- K8s State 和 Metrics 一致显示 Pod 卡在挂载阶段，排除了启动后崩溃的可能。\n\n**未知项：** 无法判断 ConfigMap `unavailable-config` 是意外删除还是从未创建，但这不影响挂载失败的直接原因判定。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 15.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 47.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w: 47.8s (Evidence 39.5s, RCA 8.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 72.099, "metrics": {"run_id": "7b391d10f01b4e03", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 72.11500191688538, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 72115.00191688538, "llm_calls": 17, "llm_duration_ms": 67862.51616477966, "tool_calls": 17, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_c